  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Crash Party STRESS DIAL object (cp_dial_mob). Deliberately inert and deliberately EMPTY: no inventory, no equipment, Lootable=0, Disarmable=0, Plot=1. A spawned NPC carrying anything real is the classic pickpocket duplication bug, so this one carries nothing at all. NO_LEASH=1 because it is spawned at runtime and has no home to be sent back to; that is also what satisfies tests/check_spawn_leash.py. Tag is cp_load so cp_sweep.nss collects it. OnSpawn starts cp_pengai.nss (wander / rummage / drink / belch / fall over). NO_LEASH=1 still satisfies tests/check_spawn_leash.py, so adding an OnSpawn does not change what that gate sees."
  },
